Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:01:28.99,0:01:29.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:03:00.03,0:03:00.08,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:14:24.01,0:14:24.05,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
Comment: 50,0:22:23.03,0:22:23.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,edsync,ED
Comment: 50,0:23:53.04,0:23:53.08,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.06,0:00:43.40,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll set up here tonight.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:55.70,0:00:57.33,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,This'll do.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:00.46,0:01:02.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can't sleep...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:02.58,0:01:05.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,All because I drank coffee in the evening.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.84,0:01:07.59,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I told you not to.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.17,0:01:11.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But it's cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:12.89,0:01:13.72,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:25.52,0:01:28.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What's that guy doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.50,0:03:07.13,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,Fuu-chan, bye-bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.13,0:03:08.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.42,0:03:11.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So sleepy...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.34,0:03:14.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wonder what that was last night.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.38,0:03:16.88,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.88,0:03:21.39,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You saw him too, Uguisu.\NHe was in the garden, all glittery.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.39,0:03:22.77,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Glittery?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.77,0:03:24.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.18,0:03:26.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Maybe I was just half-asleep.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.06,0:03:29.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.11,0:03:38.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,He {\i1}is{\i0} there!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.91,0:03:40.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,The man from last night...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.41,0:03:41.20,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.66,0:03:45.29,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Good day to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.29,0:03:47.42,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,I take it you reside here?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.42,0:03:49.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yes, I do...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.25,0:03:52.50,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So, what are you doing in our garden?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.50,0:03:55.34,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,It's a beautiful garden,\Nso I figured I'd help myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.34,0:03:59.51,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you... wait, no!\NYou can't come in here without asking!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.64,0:04:03.89,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,I came in here assuming\Nit was home to fellow magic beings,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.89,0:04:06.10,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,but you appear to be human.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.10,0:04:09.48,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Yet I can sense a twinkle of magic power.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.48,0:04:13.15,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? No way! There's no magic power here at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.15,0:04:17.90,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Rest easy. I come from Felix Star.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.90,0:04:22.20,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,There's no trouble if citizens\Nof the magical land find out.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.20,0:04:23.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.20,0:04:27.16,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm Nonoyama Fuu. What's your name?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.16,0:04:33.09,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,My name is Piyopiyon Ponporone Nyororond VI.{ピヨピヨン・ポンポローヌ・ニョロロンド・6世}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.09,0:04:35.09,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's a real mouthful...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.88,0:04:42.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, so... I was given magic power,\Nbut I can't get it to work right.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.76,0:04:44.35,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Do you know why?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.52,0:04:49.14,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Well, there's many different kinds of magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.56,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Take this, for example.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.78,0:05:01.07,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,This type of spell should be simple enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.07,0:05:02.62,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.07,0:05:03.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.83,0:05:07.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sir, please become my magic teacher!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.33,0:05:08.54,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Your teacher?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.54,0:05:12.50,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah! I wanna get better at using magic!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.05,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'm not quite sure...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It'll be perfect! Pretty please!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.05,0:05:22.39,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.72,0:05:23.51,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.51,0:05:25.47,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.47,0:05:27.31,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Well, then. Let's be off.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.31,0:05:28.72,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Off? To where?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.27,0:05:38.48,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,This is not a place fit to learn about magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.48,0:05:41.07,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,We must head to the magical land.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.07,0:05:42.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wait, right now?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.82,0:05:46.12,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But I was told not to go too far...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.70,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,It's Felix Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.70,0:05:51.96,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Yay, I'm going home!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.96,0:05:53.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uguisu!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.33,0:05:55.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.92,0:05:58.25,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Hurry along now.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.72,0:06:02.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.68,0:06:06.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.77,0:06:11.14,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I have to hurry.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.52,0:06:16.65,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.28,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,What are you doing today?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.70,0:06:27.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm recording an audition video\Nat the agency.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.20,0:06:29.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,"Attention, please!"
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.29,0:06:31.04,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.62,0:06:33.96,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.92,0:06:37.75,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.67,0:06:40.46,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.46,0:06:42.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}This person seems suspicious...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.26,0:06:46.39,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are they from the magical land?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.60,0:06:49.26,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I'm looking for directions.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.97,0:06:54.64,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Do you know the way to this place\Ncalled Café Dubdub?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.02,0:06:57.15,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I'm meeting a friend there.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.15,0:06:59.57,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The café next door to the agency...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.57,0:07:02.19,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm going to the area, so I'll guide you there.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.19,0:07:04.32,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,You will? Thanks a ton!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.95,0:07:09.16,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I heard their panini are super good!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.16,0:07:10.70,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.83,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,The cheese is so melty.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.29,0:07:15.04,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Do you go there often?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.04,0:07:16.71,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.71,0:07:18.04,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.04,0:07:20.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.84,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Ah, yep, this is the place! Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.84,0:07:25.09,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be off now...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.09,0:07:25.97,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Wait up.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.51,0:07:28.30,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,I'll treat you for helping me out!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.93,0:07:31.43,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's fine! I have somewhere to be...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.76,0:07:33.72,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,No need to be so humble!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.72,0:07:36.35,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.94,0:07:45.95,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,This is the magical land,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.49,0:07:48.49,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Felix Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.95,0:07:51.91,Default,Magic Being (Cat),0,0,0,,What do you wanna get to eat?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.91,0:07:52.95,Default,Magic Being (Pig),0,0,0,,Lemme think.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.75,0:08:00.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.29,0:08:02.71,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It feels so nostalgic.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.17,0:08:06.17,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Nice fresh air!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.43,0:08:13.60,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute! What of our magic lesson?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.60,0:08:15.47,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.02,0:08:17.89,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Now, let us begin.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.89,0:08:18.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.65,0:08:20.86,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Eggs?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.86,0:08:23.48,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,They're for magic training.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.48,0:08:26.15,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Beginners start with these.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.15,0:08:27.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.36,0:08:30.61,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Use magic to turn this into something you like.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.61,0:08:31.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.83,0:08:37.00,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,O egg, become a cake!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.02,0:08:39.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So exciting!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.05,0:08:47.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I messed up.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.67,0:08:51.01,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Hmm, you're not quite casting it right.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.39,0:08:55.77,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,It's as if you're grabbing an eel\Nthen letting it slip through your hands.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.14,0:08:57.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.27,0:09:01.02,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,It's important for you to be focused\Nwhen making a wish.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.15,0:09:08.49,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,When casting magic, you shouldn't go after eels.\NYou must try to catch something bigger, like fried shrimp.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.03,0:09:11.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.03,0:09:13.16,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Now, give it another try.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.66,0:09:16.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.41,0:09:19.00,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,O egg, become chocolate!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.21,0:09:27.09,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay, Kabappy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.09,0:09:28.34,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,That's not chocolate.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.34,0:09:31.68,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I guess I messed up after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.09,0:09:36.18,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's too cramped here\Nto give you the right motivation.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.18,0:09:40.31,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,I know a better place up ahead,\Nso let's give it a try there.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.31,0:09:43.19,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, can you make the lesson\Neasier to understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.19,0:09:45.90,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Now, you're not too bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.90,0:09:49.44,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,After all, most humans can't use magic at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.44,0:09:53.91,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,You can because you have strong feelings inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.66,0:09:58.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I have... strong feelings...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Why is this happening...?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.41,0:10:04.96,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Wow, this place is pretty neat.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.96,0:10:07.21,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I have somewhere to be...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.38,0:10:10.01,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Good afternoon!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.84,0:10:12.22,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Welcome in!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.55,0:10:15.80,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Yo, been a while!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.80,0:10:17.18,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Coming in.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.56,0:10:19.93,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,You look well.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.56,0:10:21.73,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Meeter?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.60,0:10:24.56,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Oh, fancy seeing you here!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.06,0:10:26.23,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Which means you must be...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.57,0:10:28.98,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Meeter-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.98,0:10:31.40,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm Lulu.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.40,0:10:33.78,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Azuki's told me all about you.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.24,0:10:37.49,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,I loved your last TV performance.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.91,0:10:39.70,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you very much...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.37,0:10:42.71,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,for the power I have now.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.83,0:10:46.79,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Hey, you two know each other?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.26,0:10:53.51,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I'm the cat here!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.01,0:10:55.38,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Can I take your order?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.38,0:10:58.18,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,A magical juice and a fried combo juice.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.18,0:10:59.89,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Oh, and a black tea.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.89,0:11:02.35,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,And panini for the whole table!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.73,0:11:04.27,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.27,0:11:06.52,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Three sugar cubes for the black tea, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.61,0:11:10.36,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Um, what brings you here, Meeter-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.82,0:11:13.53,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,I'm here to meet him.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.53,0:11:17.36,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,So, how are the preparations coming along?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.36,0:11:21.70,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Well, the committee's reached out\Nto a bunch of folks,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.70,0:11:24.87,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,but none of them have really stuck out to us.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.37,0:11:27.63,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Have you picked out a venue?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.63,0:11:30.46,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,We have a few places in mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.46,0:11:32.76,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Wanted to get your thoughts on the options.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.67,0:11:36.05,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What are they talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.05,0:11:37.38,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.93,0:11:39.68,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.68,0:11:41.31,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Oh, here it comes!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.23,0:11:45.64,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Here's your black tea.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.64,0:11:47.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.73,0:11:52.15,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Don't hang around weird people like this.\NYou'll make me worried.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.11,0:11:56.40,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,N-No, I got forced into... this...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.40,0:11:58.24,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.82,0:11:58.24,Alt,Rui,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.82,0:11:58.24,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,{\an8}This tastes great!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.99,0:12:00.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.28,0:12:01.74,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,The magic mountain.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.20,0:12:05.25,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,I figure it's a great spot for training.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.41,0:12:10.13,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Many people around here\Ngo hiking up this mountain.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,There's even taller mountains around it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.38,0:12:14.34,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,This one is better.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.67,0:12:17.93,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,The trailhead's just up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.97,0:12:20.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.18,0:12:21.72,Default,Magic Being (Gatekeeper),0,0,0,,Kids cannot enter.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.72,0:12:23.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Aw, what?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.18,0:12:26.73,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot. That'll complicate things.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.73,0:12:29.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can get in if I'm a grown-up, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.90,0:12:31.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Litto!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.90,0:12:34.40,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.19,0:12:38.11,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Pam pam power!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.70,0:12:47.91,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.91,0:12:50.12,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.12,0:12:52.75,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,You're Lilly the idol?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.75,0:12:55.42,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Clearly your transformation magic is impeccable.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.42,0:12:57.72,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You know about me?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.72,0:13:02.68,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,You don't see magical idols often,\Nso you're famous in this land.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.68,0:13:03.97,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I had no idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.68,0:13:06.35,Default,Magic Being (Gatekeeper),0,0,0,,You can pass.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.35,0:13:07.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.56,0:13:09.14,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Let us climb.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.14,0:13:09.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.15,0:13:16.53,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.03,0:13:19.07,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,This is the summit!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.07,0:13:20.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.28,0:13:21.66,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I'm beat.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.49,0:13:26.41,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Now, let us get right to training.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.41,0:13:28.91,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,What spell would you like to learn next?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.75,0:13:33.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,The other day, I got into a fight with my big sis.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.83,0:13:36.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Are there any good spells for that?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.50,0:13:40.88,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,The best remedy for a fight\Nis for both sides to apologize.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.88,0:13:43.14,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,It's the most effective spell there is.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.76,0:13:46.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Spoken like a real teacher!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.43,0:13:47.77,Default,Magic Being (Pineapple),0,0,0,,Hey, is that Lilly?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.77,0:13:49.85,Default,Magic Being (Tomato),0,0,0,,It is! It's Lilly the idol!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.02,0:13:52.85,Default,Magic Being (Wolf),0,0,0,,Wow, so cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.85,0:13:54.40,Default,Magic Being (Pineapple),0,0,0,,I saw you on TV!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.40,0:13:56.40,Default,Magic Being (Wolf),0,0,0,,What are you in the magical land for?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.40,0:13:57.23,Default,Magic Being (Tomato),0,0,0,,Sing for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.23,0:13:58.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uh, now's not a good time.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.82,0:14:02.78,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Now, now. Lilly has magic training to get to.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.78,0:14:03.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.74,0:14:04.78,Default,Magic Being (Pineapple),0,0,0,,Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.74,0:14:04.78,Alt,Magic Being (Wolf),0,0,0,,Aw, man!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.78,0:14:07.87,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Oh, Lilly! Don't go that way!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.87,0:14:08.95,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.29,0:14:18.55,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.37,0:14:22.84,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Huh? Where has she gone to?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.06,0:14:30.31,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.31,0:14:30.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.06,0:14:34.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.61,0:14:37.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wake up, Uguisu!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.23,0:14:40.40,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.82,0:14:43.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I tripped and fell into some weird place.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.99,0:14:45.16,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.66,0:14:48.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We have to get back to the teacher.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.41,0:14:49.91,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.29,0:14:52.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.29,0:14:54.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,but let's get moving.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.29,0:15:00.42,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I'm scared... Let's leave...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.42,0:15:02.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's literally what we're doing!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.68,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,About the venue,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.68,0:15:08.43,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,how does a limestone cave sound?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.18,0:15:12.14,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Wouldn't a plateau be better?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.14,0:15:14.14,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Plateaus have stronger winds.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.14,0:15:16.65,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,But a cave would be too small.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.65,0:15:18.23,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Good point...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.65,0:15:22.78,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Um, I really should be...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.78,0:15:25.40,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something\Nto help us decide.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.40,0:15:27.49,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,I know just the thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.49,0:15:28.57,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Ms. Manager!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.57,0:15:30.37,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Mind if we go to the basement?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.37,0:15:32.83,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Huh? That's fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.91,0:15:36.79,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,We want to hear your thoughts too!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.33,0:15:39.29,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.63,0:15:41.88,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Um, thank you for the meal!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.88,0:15:43.09,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I have to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.88,0:15:45.05,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.51,0:15:50.26,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What were those two doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.26,0:15:52.26,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Let's go to work.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.26,0:15:54.18,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Did you want to use the TV?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.18,0:15:54.93,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.69,0:16:04.74,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Oh, so this is what the basement looks like.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.74,0:16:07.78,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Normally only regulars are allowed in here.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.58,0:16:12.53,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,I'll turn it on.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.37,0:16:18.37,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Ooh, I like the look of that!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.37,0:16:20.67,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,Let's see a plateau.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.17,0:16:24.17,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,I think this is better.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.17,0:16:26.51,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Nah, the cave still beats that.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.18,0:16:34.35,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,No way! Why is Lilly there?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.18,0:16:38.06,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,I have an urgent matter,\Nso please watch the store for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.73,0:16:40.77,Default,Meeter/Oleans,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.15,0:16:45.15,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Lilly... Fuu...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.15,0:16:47.53,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Why are you in the magical land?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.50,0:17:00.37,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Fuu, wait for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.29,0:17:06.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.01,0:17:09.63,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hello! Anyone?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.39,0:17:13.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.01,0:17:16.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,There were so many people around before...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.64,0:17:18.39,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Where'd they all go?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.39,0:17:21.48,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go home already.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.48,0:17:23.48,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I want to go home too, you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.82,0:17:25.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.69,0:17:27.15,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.96,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,I can't believe she came here...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.50,0:17:48.67,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,That mountain...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.13,0:17:53.01,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,If a human goes into the holy land\Ndeep in its forest, it'll cause a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.01,0:17:59.89,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,The "no entry" sign was knocked over...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.89,0:18:01.60,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,She really is in here.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.06,0:18:06.11,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,I have to get her out safely,\Nor Shio will be mad at me.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.24,0:18:15.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Are we really going the right way?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.53,0:18:16.95,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.95,0:18:20.70,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I thought the magic world\Nwould be a lot more fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.70,0:18:22.83,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is{\i0} fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.64,0:18:42.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Is anyone there?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.44,0:18:44.39,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.39,0:18:45.48,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,She's this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.90,0:18:49.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,There's no one here... This is bad...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.86,0:18:51.28,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.28,0:18:53.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uguisu, do something.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.53,0:18:54.91,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,No, you do something.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.53,0:18:57.32,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.20,0:19:00.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,The egg my teacher gave me!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.62,0:19:02.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.29,0:19:04.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,o egg, get us out of this forest!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.92,0:19:11.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's so warm.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.26,0:19:13.47,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,So pretty!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.97,0:19:19.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I feel a lot better now.\NLet's go, Uguisu.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.60,0:19:20.31,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.99,0:19:35.61,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Lilly, where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.07,0:19:40.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What's that thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.95,0:19:44.62,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the exit! Let's check it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.21,0:19:48.83,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.46,0:19:53.00,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.03,0:20:17.03,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,I was just in time.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.45,0:20:23.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? We're back.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.41,0:20:24.49,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.49,0:20:26.75,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.75,0:20:29.88,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,There you are. I've been looking all over!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.21,0:20:32.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Teacher! Where did you go?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.46,0:20:35.26,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to ask you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.21,0:20:38.76,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Would you like to resume your magic training?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.59,0:20:42.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.47,0:20:46.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Besides, I feel like I improved a bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.68,0:20:50.98,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,I see. That's good to hear.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.98,0:20:53.94,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Then I shall take you home.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.15,0:21:00.11,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Teacher!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.49,0:21:03.95,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,No more entering stranger's gardens, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.95,0:21:04.83,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.33,0:21:06.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.29,0:21:07.58,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.04,0:21:14.63,Default,Gentleman,0,0,0,,Though, it truly was a beautiful garden.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.09,0:21:20.30,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Attention, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.64,0:21:23.97,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That was perfect!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.97,0:21:26.72,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Good work...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.18,0:21:28.27,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lilly?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.27,0:21:30.98,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What are you here for?\NYou don't have any work today.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.77,0:21:35.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Just wanted to see you all, I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.40,0:21:38.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.24,0:21:39.61,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A lot.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.61,0:21:42.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It was just... crazy! So much stuff happened!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.07,0:21:42.91,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.91,0:21:44.78,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That, I can't really say.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.78,0:21:45.53,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.53,0:21:46.41,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.41,0:21:47.91,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.91,0:21:49.37,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,It was rough.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.37,0:21:50.71,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.79,0:21:53.63,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But I'm glad you came!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.63,0:21:56.21,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I have good news for you and Lulu!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.21,0:21:57.00,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.67,0:21:58.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.63,0:22:01.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You see... You'll never guess what it is...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.47,0:22:03.13,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Out with it already.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.43,0:22:07.39,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We've set up a concert for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.22,0:22:09.89,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,A concert...?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.35,0:22:13.65,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It'll be just you two, Lilly and Lulu.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.52,0:22:16.06,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,Just us two?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.02,0:22:21.11,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,A concert?!
Comment: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:05.04,Signs,,0,0,0,,Title Card
