Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.00,0:01:35.04,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Bubee, bubee
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.04,0:01:37.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.71,0:01:40.42,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.01,0:01:43.68,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Ooh, ooh, ooh
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.68,0:01:45.72,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}You're my little buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.72,0:01:50.27,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Hey, bubee love
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.97,0:01:50.93,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Bubee, bubee, bubee love
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.93,0:01:53.60,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}My heart is racing like crazy{ドキドキしている私}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.60,0:01:56.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}And right before my eyes{この目に映るのは}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.23,0:01:59.02,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Are the colors of a brand new world{新しい世界の色}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.48,0:02:00.53,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Whoa
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.57,0:02:04.20,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Stay with me today{今日もそばにいて}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.20,0:02:07.20,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}We'll walk hand in hand{君の手を取って行こう}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.20,0:02:10.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Dreaming of the place where we can become light{光に成れる場所に憧れて}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.58,0:02:17.00,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}I can hear the magic{魔法の音がする}
